  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/IMG_6594.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Club de Patinaje Ondawheelz organiz&oacute; el 1de mayo de 2017 la I patinada Popular, con dos recorridos, uno m&aacute;s corto, que ten&iacute;a continuaci&oacute;n para quienes quer&iacute;an patinar m&aacute;s. La salida era en el Raval de Sant Josep y la llegada en ambos casos al pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6586.jpg\" alt=\"img_6586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6589.jpg\" alt=\"img_6589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6593.jpg\" alt=\"img_6593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6594.jpg\" alt=\"img_6594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6595.jpg\" alt=\"img_6595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6596.jpg\" alt=\"img_6596\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6597.jpg\" alt=\"img_6597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6598.jpg\" alt=\"img_6598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patinadapopularonda/img_6600.jpg\" alt=\"img_6600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https:/